el%20breached%20a%20third-party%20system%20due%20to%20a%20misconfiguration%20by%20Irregular.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EMeta%20joins%20other%20AI%20firms%20like%20OpenAI%20and%20Anthropic%2C%20that%20have%20also%20dealt%20with%20rogue%20AI%20cybersecurity%20incidents.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThese%20incidents%20have%20prompted%20calls%20for%20more%20regulation%20and%20transparency%20in%20AI%20cybersecurity.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EMeta%20has%20joined%20a%20growing%20list%20of%20companies%20saying%20their%20models%20hacked%20into%20an%20external%20company's%20system%20during%20cybersecurity%20testing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20a%20statement%20on%20Thursday%2C%20the%20social%20media%20company%20said%20its%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmeta-launches-muse-spark-1-1-cost-effective-ai-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EMuse%20Spark%20model%3C%2Fa%3E%20%26quot%3Bexploited%20a%20security%20vulnerability%20in%20a%20third-party%20service%2C%20in%20a%20manner%20similar%20to%20previously-reported%20instances%20with%20other%20companies.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Meta%20spokesperson%20said%20the%20breach%20occurred%20because%20of%20a%20misconfiguration%20by%20Irregular%2C%20an%20independent%20company%20Meta%20uses%20for%20model%20testing.%20This%20led%20to%20the%20model%20accessing%20the%20internet%20during%20evaluation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMeta%20added%20that%20it%20learned%20of%20the%20incident%20when%20Irregular%20notified%20the%20company.%20It%20says%20it%20is%20investigating%20the%20incident%20and%20plans%20to%20issue%20a%20full%20retrospective%20once%20the%20company%20has%20all%20the%20details.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20a%20statement%20to%20Business%20Insider%20on%20Wednesday%2C%20Irregular%20said%20the%20incident%20comes%20down%20to%20the%20same%20evaluation%20environment%20issue%20that%20Anthropic%20disclosed%20last%20week.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThis%20did%20not%20involve%20a%20sandbox%20escape%20or%20a%20sophisticated%20cyber%20action.%20There%20are%20no%20current%20open%20issues%2C%26quot%3B%20an%20Irregular%20spokesperson%20said.%20%26quot%3BIrregular%20is%20developing%20a%20white%20paper%20to%20share%20best%20practices%20for%20containment%20and%20securely%20running%20cyber%20evals.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20Information%20first%20reported%20on%20the%20Meta%20AI%20model%20incident%20on%20Wednesday.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMeta%20is%20the%20third%20AI%20giant%20to%20report%20such%20a%20rogue%20agent%20breach%20in%20the%20last%20few%20weeks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELate%20last%20month%2C%20open-source%20AI%20platform%20Hugging%20Face%20said%20that%20it%20had%20experienced%20a%20cybersecurity%20breach%20in%20which%20an%20AI%20agent%20had%20accessed%20some%20of%20its%20systems.%20OpenAI%20disclosed%20that%20two%20of%20its%20models%20escaped%20a%20test%20environment%20and%20were%20responsible%20for%20the%20rogue%20hack.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20Wednesday%2C%20OpenAI%20self-reported%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-rogue-ai-agents-testing-environment-misconfiguration-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etwo%20more%20security%20lapses%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20in%20addition%20to%20the%20Hugging%20Face%20hacking%20incident.%20The%20AI%20lab%20said%20that%20the%20incidents%20occurred%20while%20external%20parties%20were%20testing%20the%20model's%20capabilities.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELast%20week%2C%20Anthropic%20disclosed%20a%20similar%20incident%2C%20saying%20that%20it%20found%20three%20cases%20of%20Claude%20%3Ca%20rel%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fanthropic-says-claude-models-went-rogue-hacked-3-companies-testing-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_self%5C%22%3E%3Cu%3Emodels%20gaining%20unauthorized%20access%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20other%20companies'%20systems.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThese%20hacking%20incidents%20have%20prompted%20calls%20for%20more%20AI%20safety%20regulation%20and%20reporting.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20an%20interview%20with%20CBS%20that%20aired%20on%20Sunday%2C%20Hugging%20Face%20CEO%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhugging-face-ceo-clem-delangue-openai-rogue-agent-hack-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cu%3EClem%20Delangue%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%C2%A0called%20for%20mandatory%20disclosures%20of%20AI%20cyberattacks.%20Transparency%20can%20help%20everyone%20learn%20about%20and%20prevent%20attacks%2C%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BFor%20these%20cyber%20attacks%2C%20we%20should%20be%20able%20to%20see%20what%20we%20call%20the%20agent%20traces%2C%20which%20is%20basically%20what%20the%20engineers%20asked%20the%20agents%2C%20and%20then%20what%20steps%20the%20agents%20took%20to%20understand%20if%20it%20was%20a%20human%20mistake%2C%20if%20it%20was%20a%20system%20mistake%2C%20if%20it%20was%20an%20AI%20mistake%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20response%20to%20the%20first%20OpenAI%20incident%2C%20Aaron%20Levie%2C%20the%20CEO%20of%20Box%2C%20said%20the%20attack%20was%20an%20example%20of%20the%20%26quot%3Bwild%20times%26quot%3B%20we%20are%20headed%20toward%20with%20AI.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIf%20you%20were%20wondering%20how%20powerful%20AI%20is%20getting%2C%20Agents%20are%20now%20capable%20of%20escaping%20out%20of%20systems%2C%20finding%20their%20way%20to%20the%20internet%2C%20discovering%20zero%20day%20security%20vulnerabilities%20along%20the%20way%2C%20and%20then%20breaking%20into%20external%20systems%20-%20all%20in%20an%20attempt%20to%20complete%20their%20goal%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote%20on%20X%20last%20month.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmeta-says-ai-agents-went-rogue-hack-testing-openai-anthropic-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785981724000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a73e7c38fcc2e955f7dda54%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmeta-says-ai-agents-went-rogue-hack-testing-ope