%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EDoorDash's%20delivery%20robot%3C%2Fa%3E%20isn't%20quite%20ready%20for%20prime%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20delivery%20service%20has%20spent%20the%20last%20several%20months%20testing%20its%20Dot%20delivery%20robot%20as%20it%20makes%20deliveries%20in%20parts%20of%20Phoenix%2C%20Arizona.%20And%20while%20the%20company%20is%20working%20on%20securing%20permits%20for%20Dot%20to%20expand%20to%20other%20cities%2C%20there's%20still%20a%20lot%20that%20the%20company%20needs%20to%20figure%20out%20before%20it%20expands%20the%20autonomous%20delivery%20option%2C%20CEO%20Tony%20Xu%20said%20on%20a%20second-quarter%20earnings%20call%20on%20Wednesday.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI'm%20a%20big%20believer%20that%20you%20really%20have%20to%20nail%20something%20before%20you%20scale%20it%2C%26quot%3B%20Xu%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETo%20make%20autonomous%20deliveries%20work%2C%20DoorDash%20has%20to%20correctly%20estimate%20how%20long%20it%20will%20take%20restaurants%20to%20prepare%20orders%2C%20Xu%20said.%20The%20company%20also%20has%20to%20figure%20out%20how%20Dot%20can%20drop%20off%20orders%20at%20gated%20communities%20or%20interact%20with%20a%20doorman%20at%20an%20apartment%20building.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EXu%20also%20pointed%20to%20the%20issue%20of%20loading%20the%20robots.%20The%20company%20is%20paying%20some%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdoordash-pays-workers-load-dot-robots-orders-automation-limitations-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EDoorDash%20workers%3C%2Fa%3E%20about%20%245%20to%20load%20orders%20into%20Dot%20robots%2C%20Business%20Insider%20reported%20on%20Sunday.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThose%20challenges%20%26quot%3Bmight%20be%20literally%20one%20one%20thousandth%20the%20number%20of%20issues%20that%20you%20have%20to%20solve%20to%20actually%20have%20a%20chance%20at%20making%20autonomous%20deliveries%20actually%20happen%2C%26quot%3B%20Xu%20said%20on%20Wednesday's%20call.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDoorDash%20will%20also%20have%20to%20solve%20similar%20problems%20for%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdoordash-launches-drone-delivery-service-faa-certification-wing-flytrex-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EDoorDash%20Air%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20the%20drone%20delivery%20service%20that%20it%20announced%20last%20month.%20The%20company%20expects%20to%20start%20drone%20deliveries%20later%20this%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECompanies%20like%20Uber%20and%20DoorDash%20have%20turned%20to%20autonomous%20vehicles%20to%20make%20more%20ride-hailing%20trips%20and%20deliver%20more%20orders%20over%20the%20past%20year.%20Without%20people%20driving%20them%2C%20though%2C%20the%20companies%20must%20solve%20a%20number%20of%20problems.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWith%20Dot%2C%20DoorDash%20is%20trying%20to%20solve%20issues%20from%20maintenance%20and%20manufacturing%20to%20having%20infrastructure%20to%20charge%20the%20robots%2C%20the%20company%20wrote%20in%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fs22.q4cdn.com%2F280253921%2Ffiles%2Fdoc_financials%2F2026%2Fq2%2FQ2-2026-Earnings-Press-Release.pdf%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Epress%20release%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20its%20second-quarter%20earnings.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThose%20%26quot%3Bare%20all%20extremely%20difficult%20and%20must%20be%20addressed%20at%20scale%2C%26quot%3B%20DoorDash%20said%20in%20the%20release.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EDo%20you%20have%20a%20story%20idea%20about%20DoorDash%3F%20Contact%20this%20reporter%20at%20%3C%2Fem%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22mailto%3Aabitter%40businessinsider.com%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%3Cem%3E%3Cu%3Eabitter%40businessinsider.com%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cem%3E%20or%20via%20encrypted%20messaging%20app%20Signal%20at%20808-854-4501.%20Use%20a%20personal%20email%20address%2C%20a%20nonwork%20WiFi%20network%2C%20and%20a%20nonwork%20device%3B%20here's%20our%20guide%20to%20sharing%20information%20securely.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.c