.indiatimes.com%2Fphoto%2F132973971.cms%5C%22%20hspace%3D%5C%2210%5C%22%3EZendaya%20is%20having%20the%20biggest%20year%20of%20her%20career%2C%20and%20the%20numbers%20prove%20it.%20The%20actor%20has%20officially%20become%20the%20highest-grossing%20actor%20of%202026%2C%20thanks%20to%20a%20remarkable%20run%20of%20blockbuster%20releases%20led%20by%20Spider-Man%3A%20Brand%20New%20Day%20and%20Christopher%20Nolan's%20The%20Odyssey.%20With%20another%20major%20franchise%20film%2C%20Dune%3A%20Part%20Three%2C%20still%20set%20to%20arrive%20later%20this%20year%2C%20Zendaya's%20box%20office%20dominance%20appears%20far%20from%20over.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22TOI%20Entertainment%20Desk%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A10%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Lucid's%20new%20CEO%20says%20the%20EV%20maker%20launched%20cars%20before%20they%20were%20ready%20and%20let%20customers%20down%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%228192%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20silver%20Lucid%20Gravity%20SUV%20is%20parked%20next%20to%20a%20red%20Lucid%20Air%20sedan.%20They're%20both%20in%20a%20parking%20lot%20that's%20close%20to%20a%20body%20of%20water.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a734ad34327cd5a0ae2eadd%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225464%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ELucid%20said%20it's%20holding%20back%20the%20launch%20of%20its%20third%20model%20after%20its%20CEO%20said%20the%20first%20two%20launches%20were%20too%20shoddy%3Cp%3ELucid%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3ELucid's%20new%20CEO%2C%20Silvio%20Napoli%2C%20said%20the%20car%20company%20launched%20vehicles%20before%20they%20were%20ready.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EHe's%20changing%20how%20the%20EV%20maker%20launches%20vehicles%2C%20and%20pushing%20back%20the%20midsize%20Cosmos%20to%202027.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ELucid's%20two%20vehicles%20%E2%80%94%20the%20Gravity%20and%20the%20Air%20%E2%80%94%20have%20struggled%20with%20software%20issues.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3ELucid%20Motors%20has%20a%20new%20CEO%20%E2%80%94%20and%20he%20has%20a%20blunt%20new%20assessment%20of%20what's%20gone%20wrong%20at%20the%20EV%20maker.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDuring%20an%20earnings%20call%20on%20Tuesday%2C%20Silvio%20Napoli%2C%20the%20company's%20chief%20executive%20since%20June%2C%20said%20the%20automaker%20has%20%26quot%3Bdisappointed%20on%20several%20fronts%20and%20for%20far%20too%20long.%26quot%3B%20The%20company%20reported%20a%20net%20loss%20of%20more%20than%20%241%20billion%20in%20the%20quarter.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWe%20have%20not%20executed%20consistently%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BWe%20missed%20commitments%2C%20launched%20products%20before%20they%20were%20ready%2C%20under-invested%20in%20service%2C%20responded%20too%20slowly%20to%20quality%20issues%2C%20and%20allowed%20complexity%20to%20slow%20decisions%20down.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELucid%20has%20launched%20two%20luxury%20electric%20vehicles%2C%20the%20Air%20sedan%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flucid-gravity-suv-review-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ethe%20Gravity%20three-row%20SUV%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Owners%20have%20told%20the%20Business%20Insider%20that%20the%20vehicles%20have%20been%20marred%20by%20software%20glitches%2C%20including%20key%20fob%20and%20infotainment%20issues.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENow%2C%20Lucid%20says%20it%20is%20changing%20how%20it%20develops%20its%20next%20car.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat%20will%20push%20its%20planned%20launch%20of%20the%20roughly%20%2450%2C000%20midsize%20Cosmos%20into%20the%20second%20half%20of%202027%20%E2%80%94%20it%20was%20expected%20to%20start%20production%20this%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20automaker%20has%20introduced%20new%20%26quot%3Bquality%20gates%26quot%3B%20intended%20to%20ensure%20that%20all%20production%20and%20quality%20requirements%20are%20met%20before%20launch%2C%20a%20spokesperson%20told%20Business%20Insider.%20Lucid%20declined%20to%20explain%20how%20the%20checks%20differ%20from%20its%20previous%20process.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENapoli%20said%20the%20Cosmos%20%26quot%3Bwill%20launch%20only%20when%20every%20process%20and%20quality%20requirement%20has%20been%20met.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ECompany%20materials%20show%20that%20Cosmos%20prototypes%20are%20undergoing%20crash%20development%2C%20aerodynamic%20refinement%2C%20cold-weather%20evaluation%2C%20and%20battery%20and%20drive-unit%20testing.%20Lucid%20said%20more%20prototype%20builds%2C%20regulatory%20work%2C%20and%20manufacturing%20validation%20remain.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221126%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20Lucid%20Cosmos%20midsize%20SUV%20is%20being%20tested%20in%20the%20snow.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a73a0280c0bf4e8be521ede%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22440%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ELucid%20said%20it's%20testing%20the%20coming%20Cosmos%20midsize%20SUV.%20Production%20was%20pushed%20back%20to%20next%20year.%3Cp%3ELucid%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20delay%20gives%20rivals%20more%20time%20to%20establish%20themselves%20in%20the%20midsize%20electric%20SUV%20market.%20Rivian%20began%20delivering%20its%20R2%20in%20June%2C%20while%20Tesla%20recently%20brought%20the%20three-row%20Model%20Y%20L%20to%20the%20US.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELucid%20was%20founded%20by%20former%20Tesla%20engineers%20seeking%20to%20build%20a%20more%20efficient%20EV%20and%20is%20backed%20by%20Saudi%20Arabia's%20Public%20Investment%20Fund.%20It%20has%20lost%20money%20since%20it%20began%20producing%20cars.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20company%20has%20already%20scaled%20back%20significantly%20this%20year%20after%20overproducing%20its%20Gravity%20SUV.%20It%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flucid-layoffs-read-memo-us-workforce-tesla-rival-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecut%2012%25%20of%20its%20workforce%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20February%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flucid-layoffs-coo-role-eliminated-20