3D%5C%224000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Mark%20Zuckerberg%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a73a2ff8fcc2e955f7dd954%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMeta%20announced%20a%20new%20coding%20agent%2C%20Muse%20Code%2C%20that%20will%20be%20priced%20lower%20than%20its%20competitors%20at%20Anthropic%20and%20OpenAI.%3Cp%3EDavid%20Paul%20Morris%2FBloomberg%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EMeta%20announced%20a%20new%20coding%20agent%20called%20Muse%20Code%20that's%20made%20to%20handle%20software%20engineering%20tasks.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EIt's%20Meta's%20answer%20to%20other%20popular%20coding%20agents%2C%20such%20as%20Anthropic's%20Claude%20and%20OpenAI's%20Codex.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EMeta%20said%20Muse%20Code%20is%20intended%20to%20be%20a%20lower-cost%20alternative%20to%20other%20agents.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EMeta%20is%20entering%20the%20coding%20wars%20with%20a%20new%20agent%20aimed%20at%20taking%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-anthropic-ai-coding-database-intent-samuel-colvin-pydantic-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAnthropic%20and%20OpenAI.%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20company%20announced%20Wednesday%20a%20beta%20version%20of%20Muse%20Code%20%E2%80%94%20powered%20by%20its%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmeta-launches-muse-spark-1-1-cost-effective-ai-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EMuse%20Spark%3C%2Fa%3E%201.2%20AI%20model%20%E2%80%94%20that%20Meta%20said%20can%20handle%20complex%20software%20engineering%20tasks%2C%20such%20as%20writing%20code%20and%20validating%20results.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMuse%20Code%20is%20Meta's%20answer%20to%20tools%20like%20Anthropic's%20Claude%20Code%20and%20OpenAI's%20Codex%2C%20which%20have%20become%20increasingly%20popular%20among%20developers.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Falexandr-wang-scale-ai-meta-zuckerberg-mit-dropout-net-worth-2025-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EMeta's%20AI%20chief%20Alexandr%20Wang%3C%2Fa%3E%20said%20in%20an%20X%20post%20that%20Muse%20Code%20is%20%26quot%3Bone%20of%20the%20most%20affordable%20coding%20agents%20on%20the%20market%2C%20available%20globally.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20standard%20version%20of%20Muse%20Spark%201.2%20costs%20%241.25%20per%20million%20input%20tokens%2C%2015%20cents%20per%20million%20cached-input%20tokens%2C%20and%20%244.25%20per%20million%20output%20tokens.%20Tokens%20are%20small%20pieces%20of%20text%20or%20code%20that%20AI%20models%20process.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20heavily%20discounted%20%26quot%3Bcontributor%26quot%3B%20tier%20comes%20with%20a%20stipulation%20that%20user%20activity%20will%20be%20used%20to%20improve%20Meta's%20products.%20That%20could%20appeal%20to%20individual%20developers%20and%20startups%2C%20while%20companies%20working%20with%20proprietary%20code%20may%20prefer%20the%20standard%20tier.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDirect%20comparisons%20can%20be%20difficult%20since%20Claude%20Code%20and%20Codex%20are%20bundled%20into%20subscriptions.%20Anthropic's%20Pro%20Plan%2C%20which%20is%20%2420%20a%20month%2C%20includes%20Claude%20Code%2C%20while%20Max%20plans%20cost%20%24100%20to%20%24200%20a%20month.%20OpenAI's%20Codex%20is%20available%20through%20a%20ChatGPT%20Plus%20plan%20that%20costs%20%2420%20a%20month.%20OpenAI's%20Pro%20plan%20costs%20%24100%20a%20month.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20launch%20reflects%20how%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Feveryone-is-building-everything-openai-anthropic-lovable-cursor-canva-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esoftware%20coding%3C%2Fa%3E%20has%20become%20a%20critical%20part%20of%20the%20AI%20battleground.%20Unlike%20a%20standard%20chatbot%2C%20a%20coding%20agent%20can%20examine%20a%20company's%20software%2C%20run%20tests%2C%20and%20write%20code%20with%20limited%20supervision.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnthropic%20gained%20early%20traction%20with%20Claude%20Code%2C%20while%20OpenAI%20expanded%20Codex%20across%20ChatGPT%20and%20developer%20terminals.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDuring%20Meta's%20first-quarter%20earnings%20call%20in%20April%2C%20CEO%20Mark%20Zuckerberg%20said%20that%20developer%20tools%20weren't%20the%20company's%20primary%20focus%2C%20though%20he%20added%20that%20he%20was%20not%20opposed%20to%20offering%20coding%20tools.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWith%20Muse%20Code%2C%20Meta%20seems%20to%20be%20hoping%20to%20attract%20the%20same%20programmers%20who%20might%20use%20Claude%20or%20Codex%20by%20offering%20a%20comparable%20agent%20at%20a%20lower%20price.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmeta-muse-coding-agent-race-openai-codex-anthropic-claude-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785965505000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a73a30b8fcc2e955f7dd958%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmeta-muse-coding-agent-race-openai-codex-anthropic-claude-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Meta%20launched%20Muse%20Code%2C%20which%20aims%20to%20be%20a%20comparable%20coding%20agent%20that's%20priced%20lower%20than%20competitors%20like%20Anthropic's%20Claude%20or%20OpenAI's%20Codex.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22lloydlee%40insider.com%20(Lloyd%20Lee)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A96%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Two%20Kanwariyas%20Killed%20As%20Car%20Rams%20Motorcycle%20In%20UP%3A%20Cops%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22Two%20Kanwariyas%20were%20killed%20and%20another%20was%20seriously%20injured%20after%20a%20speeding%20car%20hit%20their%20motorcycle%20on%20the%20Delhi-Dehradun%20National%20Highway%20here%20early%20Wednesday%2C%20police%20said.%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785964501000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fc.ndtvimg.com%2F2022-12%2F0htt5beg_india-police-generic_625x300_23_December_22.jpg%3Fim%3DFeatureCrop%2Calgorithm%3Ddnn