%20use%20the%20transition%20as%20a%20chance%20to%20improve%20execution%20and%20culture.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3ECorie%20Henson%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmrbeast%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EMrBeast's%3C%2Fa%3E%20studio%20head%2C%20is%20leaving%20after%20just%20under%20a%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20former%20NBCUniversal%20unscripted%20EVP%20was%20among%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmrbeast-builds-management-team-with-hires-from-tiktok-snapchat-nbcu-2025-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebatch%20of%20hires%3C%2Fa%3E%20with%20big%20media%20pedigrees%2C%20reflecting%20the%20company's%20ambitions%20to%20become%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmrbeast-building-next-disney-ceo-pitching-beast-industries-to-investors-2025-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EDisney-style%20entertainment%20colossus%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BBeing%20surrounded%20by%20people%20who%20care%20so%20deeply%20about%20making%20great%20content%20has%20completely%20changed%20the%20way%20I%20think%20about%20YouTube%20and%20storytelling%2C%20and%20I'm%20incredibly%20grateful%20for%20how%20generous%20everyone%20has%20been%20along%20the%20way%2C%26quot%3B%20Henson%20wrote%20in%20a%20Slack%20message%20that%20was%20shared%20internally%20by%20Beast%20Industries%20CEO%20Jeff%20Housenbold.%20%26quot%3BAfter%20a%20year%20away%20from%20my%20family%20and%20home%2C%20though%2C%20I%20know%20it's%20time%20for%20me%20to%20get%20back%20to%20them.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHenson%20had%20moved%20from%20Los%20Angeles%20to%20Greenville%2C%20North%20Carolina%2C%20where%20MrBeast's%20operation%20is%20headquartered.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHousenbold%20said%20in%20a%20Slack%20message%20to%20staff%20that%20he%20would%20use%20the%20transition%20%26quot%3Bas%20an%20opportunity%20to%20increase%20our%20execution%20while%20simultaneously%20strengthening%20our%20culture.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHousenbold%20s