20Rico%2C%20like%20any%20place%2C%20it%20has%20its%20own%20local%20issues%20and%20problems%20that%20others%20hoping%20to%20move%20here%20may%20want%20to%20keep%20in%20mind.%3Cp%3EJared%20Ranahan%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EIn%202024%2C%20I%20moved%20from%20Massachusetts%20to%20Puerto%20Rico%20to%20be%20with%20my%20boyfriend%2C%20who's%20from%20there.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EOn%20a%20regular%20basis%2C%20the%20unreliable%20electric%20grid%20and%20water%20interruptions%20can%20be%20difficult%20to%20manage.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EAlthough%20I%20wish%20there%20were%20more%20walkable%20areas%20and%20great%20public-transit%20options%2C%20I%20love%20living%20here.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EDuring%20a%20recent%20visit%20to%20New%20York%2C%20my%20boyfriend%20and%20I%20struck%20up%20a%20conversation%20with%20a%20bartender%20at%20our%20hotel.%20Upon%20mentioning%20where%20we%20were%20visiting%20from%2C%20we%20were%20met%20with%20a%20jovial%20%26quot%3BWow%2C%20you%20two%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhy-americans-moving-to-puerto-rico-tax-incentives-luxury-living-2025-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Elive%20in%20Puerto%20Rico%3C%2Fa%3E%3F%20What's%20life%20like%20in%20paradise%3F%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20a%20sentiment%20that%20I've%20heard%20frequently%20over%20the%20past%20few%20years.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20boyfriend%20(a%20Puerto%20Rican%20native%20from%20Bayam%C3%B3n)%20and%20I%20met%20a%20few%20years%20ago%20while%20I%20was%20visiting%20the%20island%20for%20a%20wedding%2C%20and%20after%20a%20bout%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftips-for-being-in-a-long-distance-relationship-2017-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Elong-distance%20dating%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20I%20moved%20from%20Massachusetts%20to%20Puerto%20Rico%20in%20September%202024%20to%20take%20the%20next%20step%20in%20our%20relationship.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20loved%20living%20here%2C%20and%20I%20have%20zero%20regrets%20about%20my%20move%2C%20but%20I'll%20be%20the%20first%20to%20say%20relocating%20here%20is%20not%20something%20to%20be%20taken%20lightly.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPuerto%20Rico%20is%20a%20phenomenal%20place%2C%20but%20it's%20not%20always%20the%20stress-free%20island%20paradise%20that%20some%20paint%20it%20out%20to%20be.%20I%20feel%20that%20any%20potential%20newcomers%20should%20be%20aware%20of%20the%20obstacles%20that%20they%20might%20encounter%20before%20making%20the%20move.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2249d84321-fdde-4668-9e4d-73279b2a971c%5C%22%3EDaily%20life%20can%20be%20interrupted%20by%20unreliable%20infrastructure%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222316%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Two%20men%20smiling%20together%20on%20beach%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a67a7df54f987526177a3b0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221737%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EPuerto%20Rico%20is%20beautiful%2C%20but%20like%20any%20place%2C%20it%20has%20its%20issues.%3Cp%3EJared%20Ranahan%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20many%20Puerto%20Rico%20residents%2C%20the%20most%20pressing%20local%20issue%20is%20its%20unreliable%20and%20aging%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nbcnews.com%2Fnews%2Flatino%2Fpuerto-rico-blackout-new-years-eve-underground-cable-outdated-rcna187134%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eelectric%20grid%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Power%20outages%2C%20known%20in%20Spanish%20as%20%26quot%3Bapagones%2C%26quot%3B%20are%20a%20common%20occurrence%20across%20the%20territory.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20events%20like%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpuerto-rico-power-outage-electricity-2024-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E2024%20New%20Year's%20Eve%20blackout%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pbs.org%2Fnewshour%2Fnation%2Fpuerto-rico-hit-with-island-wide-blackout-as-residents-prepare-for-easter-weekend%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E2025%20Easter%20Weekend%20outage%3C%2Fa%3E%20have%20made%20global%20headlines%2C%20I've%20experienced%20plenty%20of%20neighborhood-wide%20interruptions%20that%20go%20unnoticed%20outside%20of%20the%20island.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThey%20often%20happen%20without%20warning%2C%20and%20while%20my%20personal%20record%20is%20eight%20hours%20without%20electricity%2C%20some%20parts%20of%20Puerto%20Rico%20can%20go%20far%20longer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlongside%20power%2C%20I've%20also%20grappled%20with%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sanjuandailystar.com%2Fpost%2Fsenator-calls-for-prasa-chief-to-testify-as-water-failures-persist-across-pr%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ewater%20interruptions%3C%2Fa%3E%20at%20my%20San%20Juan%20apartment%2C%20leaving%20me%20unable%20to%20prepare%20for%20the%20day%20on%20multiple%20occasions.%20Given%20these%20persistent%20issues%2C%20many%20Puerto%20Ricans%20equip%20their%20homes%20with%20water%20cisterns%2C%20solar%20panels%2C%20and%20gas-powered%20generators%20to%20provide%20relief%20and%20backup.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20very%20common%20for%20me%20to%20see%20Facebook%20pages%20for%20the%20island's%20water-management%20system%20and%20private%20power%20operator%20flooded%20with%20comments%20from%20residents%20reporting%20outages%20and%20asking%20for%20updates.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22efaca4c0-9951-423a-a64f-b42425f112ec%5C%22%3ELiving%20here%20requires%20a%20bit%20of%20patience%20and%20self-awareness%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Man%20standing%20in%20front%20of%20Yauco%20sign%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a67a7dece52cb26b839463f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223213%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMoving%20to%20any%20new%20place%20can%20be%20challenging.%3Cp%3EJared%20Ranahan%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20I%20moved%20from%20a%20US%20state%20to%20a%20US%20territory%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoved-family-mainland-us-to-puerto-rico-dream-job-2025-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Erelocating%20to%20Puerto%20Rico%3C%2Fa%3E%20still%20came%20with%20bureaucratic%20challenges%20and%20delays.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EObtaining%20my%20resident%20ID%20was%20a%20frustrating%20process%20that%20involved%20several%20trips%20to%20several%20offices.%20This%20wasn't%20the%20end%20of%20the%20world%20%E2%80%94%20and%20relocating%20to%20most%20places%20comes%20with%20slow-moving%20steps%20like%20these%20%E2%80%94%20but%20it%20felt%20pretty%20inefficient.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20one%20point%2C%20I%20had%20to%20drive%2040%20minutes%20for%20an%20appointment%20to%20take%20a%20single%20webcam%20photo%2C%20which%20took%20only%20five%20minutes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESpeaking%20of%20driving%2C%20Puerto%20Rico's%20largely%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcar-free-in-the-suburbs-happier-healthier-2024-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecar-dependent%20infrastructure%3C%2Fa%3E%20makes%20it%20difficult%20to%20navigate%20the%20island%20without%20a%20vehicle.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20a%20metro-area%20resident%20who%20prefers%20to%20avoid%20driving%2C%20the%20Tren%20Urbano%20(a%20tri-city%20rapid%20transit%20system)%20has%20been%20incredibly%20useful.%20Unfortunately%2C%20although%20there%20are%20some%20options%20like%20buses%20and%20ferries%20outside%20the%20San%20Juan%20area%2C%20there's%20no%20such%20rapid%20equivalent.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225436%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22cobblestone%20street%20lined%20with%20parked%20cars%20in%20old%20san%20juan%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a67af0b54f987526177a3d8%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223629%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EIt%20can%20be%20difficult%20to%20get%20around%20certain%20areas%20without%20a%20car.%3Cp%3Eeyfoto%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAlso%2C%20many%20roads%20across%20Puerto%20Rico%20are%20infamous%20for%20their%20large%20potholes%2C%20known%20locally%20as%20%26quot%3Bboketes%2C%26quot%3B%20which%20are%20more%20than%20capable%20of%20tearing%20open%20your%20tire%20and%20leaving%20you%20stranded%20on%20the%20side%20of%20the%20road%20%E2%80%94%20something%20that%20I%20experienced%20on%20Christmas%20Day%2C%202025.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFinally%2C%20I'd%20like%20to%20stress%20that%20living%20on%20the%20island%20as%20an%20outsider%20should%20require%20a%20certain%20level%20of%20self-awareness.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20example%2C%20there%20is%20growing%20frustration%20with%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpuerto-rico-posters-call-crypto-investors-logan-paul-brock-pierce-colonizers-2022-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ewealthy%20outsiders%3C%2Fa%3E%20purchasing%20Puerto%20Rican%20land%20and%20contributing%20to%20gentrification%2C%20and%20while%20my%20circumstances%20are%20different%2C%20it%20would%20be%20hypocritical%20of%20me%20to%20say%20that%20my%20presence%20here%20has%20no%20impact.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20I'm%20proficient%20in%20Spanish%2C%20I%20have%20accepted%20that%20my%20status%20as%20a%20resident%20%26quot%3Bgringo%26quot%3B%20can%20be%20a%20point%20of%20contention%2C%20and%20I%20do%20what%20I%20can%20to%20be%20a%20respectful%20resident.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2229999004-16f0-4cad-82b9-5770f6bafc6d%5C%22%3EIn%20spite%20of%20the%20challenges%2C%20the%20culture%2C%20people%2C%20and%20nature%20make%20it%20well%20worth%20living%20here%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Man%20smiling%20with%20drink%20in%20front%20of%20artwork%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a67a7df548c9c486b311068%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223213%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EPuerto%20Rico%20has%20been%20a%20special%20place%20to%20live%20with%20incredibly%20kind%20people.%3Cp%3EJared%20Ranahan%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThough%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffamily-moved-from-us-nyc-to-puerto-rico-surprising-things-2025-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Elife%20in%20Puerto%20Rico%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20like%20all%20places%20%E2%80%94%20can%20be%20trying%20at%20times%2C%20I%20feel%20so%20fortunate%20to%20be%20here.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETourist%20hot%20spots%20like%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcheap-things-to-do-san-juan-puerto-rico-on-budget%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EViejo%20San%20Juan%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20El%20Yunque%20National%20Forest%20are%20certainly%20beautiful%2C%20and%20I've%20yet%20to%20find%20a%20municipality%20on%20the%20island%20that%20I%20didn't%20love.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20made%20so%20many%20treasured%20memories%20all%20across%20the%20territory%3A%20snacking%20on%20empanadillas%20de%20chap%C3%ADn%20(fried%20handpies%20filled%20with%20fish)%3Cem%3E%20%3C%2Fem%3Eon%20the%20Naguabo%20coast%2C%20birdwatching%20in%20the%20lagoons%20of%20Cabo%20Rojo%2C%20and%20visiting%20chinchorros%3Cem%3E%20%3C%2Fem%3E(informal%20roadside%20bars)%3Cem%3E%20%3C%2Fem%3Ein%20the%20central%20mountains%2C%20just%20to%20name%20a%20few.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOf%20course%2C%20no%20mention%20of%20Puerto%20Rico%20is%20complete%20without%20highlighting%20the%20people.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThough%20it's%20certainly%20a%20clich%C3%A9%20at%20this%20point%2C%20I%20cannot%20express%20in%20words%20how%20warm%20and%20hospitable%20everyone%20has%20been%2C%20whether%20that's%20my%20boyfriend's%20family%20or%20just%20strangers%20who%20strike%20up%20conversations%20with%20me%20while%20waiting%20for%20the%20train%20%E2%80%94%20and%20it's%20these%20constant%20moments%20of%20human%20connection%20(no%20matter%20how%20brief)%20that%20make%20it%20all%20worth%20it%20in%20the%20end.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoved-to-puerto-rico-biggest-challenges-living-here-drawbacks-outages-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785961921000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a67a7de54f987526177a3af%3Fformat%3Djpeg%2