Ful%3E%3Cp%3EFrom%20United%20Airlines%20and%20Emirates%20to%20British%20Airways%20and%20Air%20New%20Zealand%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Felon-musk%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EElon%20Musk%3C%2Fa%3E's%20Starlink%20is%20gaining%20popularity%20across%20global%20airlines.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20its%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fstarlink.com%2Fpublic-files%2FstarlinkProgressReport_2025.pdf%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E2025%20Progress%20Report%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20Starlink%20said%20more%20than%201%2C400%20commercial%20planes%20worldwide%20have%20been%20equipped%20with%20the%20ultra-high-speed%20internet.%20Over%2040%20commercial%20carriers%20have%20announced%20deals.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAll%20airlines%20that%20offer%20Starlink%20do%20so%20free%20of%20charge%2C%20although%20some%20require%20passengers%20to%20sign%20up%20for%20their%20loyalty%20programs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBusiness%20Insider%20previously%20tested%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Felon-musk-starlink-qatar-airways-productivity-bosses-video-call-meetings-2024-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EStarlink%20on%20Qatar%20Airways%3C%2Fa%3E'%20first%20flight%20with%20Starlink%20in%20October%202024.%20The%20connection%20speed%20peaked%20at%20215%20megabits%20per%20second%2C%20more%20than%20enough%20for%20a%20lag-free%20video%20call%2C%20and%20faster%20than%20many%20cable-based%20internet%20services.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStarlink%20operates%20thanks%20to%20a%20constellation%20of%20nearly%2011%2C000%20satellites%2C%20enabling%20internet%20connectivity%20in%20remote%20locations%2C%20including%20over%20oceans.%20The%20satellites%20are%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fspacex-starlink-amazon-oneweb-companies-compete-satellite-internet-2021-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Elow-earth%20orbit%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20means%20faster%20internet%20speeds%2C%20but%20they%20can%20also%20disrupt%20astronomy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EStarlink%20has%20competition%3A%20Carriers%20like%20JetBlue%20Airways%20and%20Delta%20Air%20Lines%20have%20signed%20up%20for%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famazons-leo-satellite-venture-names-first-finance-vp-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAmazon%20Leo%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20which%20works%20similarly%20and%20has%20launched%20about%20400%20satellites.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EViasat%20has%20been%20a%20common%20pick%20for%20airlines%20for%20over%20a%20decade%2C%20relying%20on%20fewer%20high-capacity%20satellites%20in%20geostationary%20orbit%20about%2022%2C000%20miles%20above%20Earth%2C%20which%20have%20higher%20latency%20than%20Starlink.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20are%20ways%20to%20find%20out%20whether%20your%20next%20flight%20is%20equipped%20with%20Starlink.%20For%20most%20airlines%2C%20passengers%20are%20notified%20during%20the%20booking%20process%2C%20in%20pre-flight%20communications%2C%20or%20via%20the%20app.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20not%20associated%20with%20Musk%20or%20the%20carriers%2C%20there%20are%20free%20online%20tools%2C%20such%20as%20Starlink%20Flights%2C%20that%20can%20be%20helpful.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20example%2C%20Starlink%20Flights%20tracks%20which%20aircraft%20tail%20numbers%20are%20equipped%20with%20Starlink%20by%20using%20airline%20announcements%2C%20public%20records%2C%20flight-tracking%20data%2C%20and%20passenger%20reports.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETravelers%20can%20use%20aviation%20tracking%20tools%20like%20FlightRadar24%20to%20find%20their%20flight's%20tail%20number%20and%20cross-check%20it.%20Still%2C%20aircraft%20swaps%20and%20data%20inaccuracies%20mean%20these%20tools%20should%20be%20treated%20as%20helpful%20guides%20rather%20than%20guarantees.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere%20are%20all%20the%20airlines%20that%20have%20publicly%20announced%20plans%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Felon-musk-starlink-satellites-internet%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Elaunch%20Starlink.%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EAe