%20economy%3C%2Fa%3E%20where%20the%20rich%20keep%20pulling%20ahead%20while%20the%20poor%20fall%20further%20behind.%20Recent%20comments%20from%20business%20executives%20and%20policymakers%20suggest%20that%20shape%20might%20be%20changing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHilton%20CEO%20Christopher%20Nassetta%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhilton-ceo-sees-c-shaped-economy-emerging-us-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esaid%20that%20sales%20growth%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20spreading%20beyond%20just%20luxury.%20And%20Treasury%20Secretary%20Scott%20Bessent%20said%20the%20economy%20is%20now%20C-shaped%2C%20with%20outcomes%20at%20either%20end%20of%20the%20wealth%20spectrum%20starting%20to%20converge.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20got%20sick%20of%20hearing%20about%20this%20K-shaped%20economy%2C%26quot%3B%20Bessent%20said%20in%20an%20interview%20with%20CNBC's%20Squawk%20Box.%20%26quot%3BI%20can%20say%20here%2C%20definitively%2C%20the%20K-shaped%20economy%20is%20over.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20the%20data%20suggests%20a%20more%20limited%20shift%3A%20lower%20earners%20have%20seen%20some%20gains%2C%20but%20higher%20earners%20are%20still%20spending%20and%20doing%20well%20enough%20that%20the%20broad%20trajectory%20of%20diverging%20economic%20outcomes%20has%20not%20fully%20changed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BC-shaped%20would%20suggest%20that%20maybe%20we're%20seeing%20some%20compression%20in%20inequality%20%E2%80%94%20that%20as%20the%20high%20end%20does%20a%20little%20bit%20worse%20and%20the%20low%20end%20does%20a%20little%20bit%20better%2C%20we%20start%20to%20meet%20more%20in%20the%20middle%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Elizabeth%20Pancotti%2C%20the%20vice%20president%20of%20policy%2C%20advocacy%2C%20and%20research%20at%20the%20Groundwork%20Collaborative%2C%20a%20left-leaning%20think%20tank.%20%26quot%3BI%20don't%20think%20we've%20seen%20any%20evidence%20to%20suggest%20that%20we're%20closing%20the%20gap%20on%20those%20things.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22c33