%20though%20its%20model%20may%20be%20an%20exception.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20of%20the%20hottest%20jobs%20at%20SpaceX%20right%20now%20relies%20on%20an%20old-fashioned%20skill%3A%20talking%20to%20people.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Felon-musk%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ECEO%20Elon%20Musk%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20who%20also%20founded%20xAI%2C%20the%20company%20behind%20the%20chatbot%20Grok%2C%20has%20spent%20years%20saying%20that%20AI%20and%20robots%20will%20take%20on%20more%20of%20the%20work%20humans%20do.%20Yet%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Felon-musk-spacex-earnings-call-ai-data-centers-starlink-revenue-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ESpaceX's%20earnings%20call%3C%2Fa%3E%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3ETuesday%2C%20he%20said%20the%20company%20is%20building%20a%20large%20enterprise%20sales%20team%20for%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Felon-musk-starlink-satellites-internet%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esatellite%20internet%20system%20Starlink%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20work%20he%20described%20in%20distinctly%20human%20terms.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThis%20requires%20just%20going%20out%20there%2C%20talking%20to%20people%2C%20educating%20them%20about%20the%20currency%20of%20the%20Starlink%20system%20and%20where%20it's%20going%2C%26quot%3B%20Musk%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMusk's%20comments%20echo%20what%20other%20business%20leaders%20told%20Business%20Insider%3A%20Even%20as%20AI%20automates%20parts%20of%20sales%2C%20winning%20complex%20deals%20still%20requires%20a%20human%20touch.%20Good%20salespeople%2C%20they%20said%2C%20give%20buyers%20confidence%20that%20someone%20will%20be%20accountable%20if%20a%20product%20or%20service%20falls%20short.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BGenerally%20speaking%2C%20people%20still%20want%20to%20buy%20from%20humans%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Brian%20Smith%2C%20founder%20of%20IA%20Business%20Advisors%2C%20a%20management%20consulting%20firm.%20%26quot%3BEven%20companies%20as%20large%20as%20SpaceX%20are%20selling%20relationships%2C%20not%20just%20a%20service%20or%20a%20technology.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22aabb6eea-f9ca-4bd1-b516-d2c895d6d1d4%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EAI%20can%20help%2C%20but%20humans%20still%20close%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EAI%20can%20still%20play%20a%20valuable%20part%20in%20the%20sales%20process.%20For%20example%2C%20it%20can%20be%20used%20for%20customer%20research%2C%20preparing%20pitch%20decks%2C%20and%20role-playing%20how%20to%20triumph%20over%20rejection.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESmith%20said%20his%20firm%20uses%20AI%20to%20create%20sales%20scripts%20tailored%20to%20prospective%20buyers%20in%20different%20regions.%20%26quot%3BAI%20is%20helping%20to%20get%20that%20done%20faster%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20technology%20is%20likely%20to%20fall%20short%2C%20however%2C%20when%20it%20comes%20to%20closing%20a%20sale.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BAI%20is%20not%20going%20out%20for%20dinner%20with%20people%20to%20buy%20and%20sell%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbig-tech-career-service-ceo-job-interview-advice-avoid-cliches-2024-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAlan%20Stein%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20CEO%20of%20a%20career-coaching%20firm%20and%20a%20former%20hiring%20manager%20at%20Google%2C%20Meta%2C%20and%20American%20Express.%20While%20AI%20may%20be%20able%20to%20replace%20some%20professionals%2C%20he%20added%20that%20%26quot%3Brelationship-driven%20roles%20like%20sales%20are%20going%20to%20be%20less%20impacted.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20Tuesday's%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fspacex-capex-ai-space-data-centers-elon-musk-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ESpaceX%20earnings%20call%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20Musk%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Esaid%20the%20sales%20team's%20job%20will%20be%20to%20convince%20corporate%20and%20government%20customers%20that%20Starlink%20is%20reliable%20enough%20to%20serve%20as%20their%20primary%20internet%20provider%2C%20rather%20than%20as%20merely%20a%20backup.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20SpaceX%20is%20a%20household%20name%20that%20recently%20pulled%20off%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fspacex-ipo-live-updates-pricing-spcx-stock-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ethe%20largest%20IPO%20in%20history%2C%3C%2Fa%3E%20it%20still%20needs%20to%20convince%20prospective%20corporate%20and%20government%20customers%20to%20purchase%20Starlink%2C%20and%20that's%20not%20something%20AI%20can%20likely%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Edo%20on%20its%20own%2C%20said%20Alex%20Sobol%2C%20cofounder%20of%20the%20Millennium%20Alliance%2C%20an%20invite-only%20community%20for%20C-suite%20executives%20in%20North%20America%20and%20Europe.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BElon's%20probably%20not%20just%20relying%20on%20the%20fact%20that%20his%20products%20and%20technologies%20are%20received%20really%20well%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Sobol.%20%26quot%3BI%20think%20he%20realizes%20this%20is%20probably%20more%20complicated%20than%20anything%20he's%20put%20to%20market%20before%2C%20and%20it's%20going%20to%20need%20a%20lot%20of%20people%20in%20the%20field%20talking%20to%20customers%2C%20potential%20customers%2C%20advocates%2C%20and%20skeptics.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22a876c7be-9c64-450b-bfa8-dd8cfb4eb27a%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EPalantir%20is%20shrinking%20its%20sales%20team%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EMusk's%20comments%20contrasted%20with%20those%20made%20by%20another%20high-profile%20CEO%20this%20week.%20Palantir%20CEO%20Alex%20Karp%20wrote%20in%20a%20shareholder%20letter%20released%20Monday%20that%20his%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Falex-karp-palantir-crushed-earnings-shrinking-sales-team-2026-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecompany's%20sales%20team%20is%20getting%20smaller%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20even%20as%20its%20commercial%20business%20is%20surging.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI