shortly%20after%20his%20first%20major%20break%20with%20the%20President%20over%20Trump's%20signature%20spending%20bill.%3Cp%3EALLISON%20ROBBERT%2FAFP%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20plaster%20relief%20of%20the%20presidential%20seal%20was%20added%20to%20the%20Oval%20Office%20in%201934%20during%20a%20White%20House%20renovation%20overseen%20by%20President%20Franklin%20D.%20Roosevelt.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EGold%20pieces%20from%20the%20White%20House%20collection%20now%20adorn%20the%20fireplace%20mantel%2C%20which%20has%20also%20been%20decorated%20with%20more%20gold%20appliqu%C3%A9s.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221024%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22King%20Charles%20and%20Donald%20Trump%20meet%20in%20the%20Oval%20Office.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F69fb7e88c9dd4cb81cda7c08%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22663%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWASHINGTON%2C%20DC%20-%20APRIL%2028%3A%20U.S.%20President%20Donald%20Trump%20(R)%20during%20a%20bilateral%20meeting%20with%20King%20Charles%20III%20in%20the%20Oval%20Office%20on%20day%20two%20of%20the%20State%20Visit%20of%20King%20Charles%20III%20and%20Queen%20Camilla%20to%20the%20United%20States%20of%20America%2C%20on%20April%2028%2C%202026%20in%20Washington%2C%20DC.%3Cp%3ESamir%20Hussein%2FWireImage%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20gilded%20urns%20and%20decorative%20pieces%20on%20the%20mantel%20date%20back%20to%20the%2019th%20century%20and%20rotate%20periodically.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ECredenzas%20on%20either%20side%20of%20the%20fireplace%20appear%20to%20be%20supported%20by%20the%20wings%20of%20gold%20eagle%20statues.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221024%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Eagle%20credenzas%20in%20the%20Oval%20Office.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F69fba131c9dd4cb81cda7d6a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22683%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWASHINGTON%2C%20DC%20-%20MAY%