.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EI%20made%20a%20few%20mistakes%20on%20my%20Amtrak%20journey%2C%20like%20booking%20a%20ticket%20with%20an%20extended%20stop.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20scheduled%20a%20getaway%20to%20Rochester%2C%20New%20York%2C%20in%20May%202025%2C%20I%20was%20more%20excited%20about%20the%20train%20rides%20there%20and%20back%20than%20the%20destination%20itself.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20wasn't%20a%20stranger%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-train-nyc-to-rochester-surprising-things-2025-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAmtrak%20trips%3C%2Fa%3E%20before%20traveling%20upstate%2C%20though%20it%20became%20my%20longest%20train%20ride%20to%20date.%20It%20would%20take%20seven%20hours%20to%20get%20there%20and%20nine%20hours%20to%20return%2C%20making%20for%20a%20whopping%2016%20hours%20on%20the%20tracks%20in%20total.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThat's%20a%20long%20time%20to%20be%20on%20a%20train%20(or%20on%20a%20plane%20or%20in%20an%20automobile)%2C%20but%20I%20was%20excited%20about%20it.%20Trains%20still%20have%20a%20novelty%20about%20them%20for%20me%2C%20and%20I%20love%20how%20easy%20they%20are%20for%20passengers.%20I%20rode%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-business-class-vs-coach-maple-leaf-train-new-york%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecoach%20on%20the%20way%20there%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20business%20class%20on%20the%20way%20back%2C%20paying%20%24249%20for%20the%20round%20trip.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBoth%20of%20my%20rides%20were%20fun%2C%20but%20I%20made%20a%20few%20travel%20mistakes%20that%20I'll%20try%20to%20avoid%20in%20the%20future.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EAlthough%20it's%20good%20to%20be%20early%2C%20I%20arrived%20a%20little%20too%20early%20for%20my%20train.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20selfie%20of%20a%20woman%20at%20Moynihan%20Train%20Hall%20at%20Penn%20Station.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F683f20caca50259add4d8656%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3ESamantha%20Pettyjohn%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAmtrak%20recommends%20passengers%20arrive%2030%20minutes%20before%20their%20trains%20are%20scheduled%20to%20depart.%20I%20am%20nothing%20if%20not%20a%20rule%20follower%2C%20so%20I%20got%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnew-york-moynihan-train-hall-photo-tour-penn-station-amtrak-2021-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EMoynihan%20Train%20Hall%20%3C%2Fa%3Eat%20Penn%20Station%20for%20my%207%3A15%20a.m.%20train%20at%206%3A37.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20grabbed%20a%20coffee%20before%20the%20Amtrak-recommended%20waiting%20period%20began%2C%20and%20by%206%3A50%2C%20I%20was%20waiting%20in%20the%20train%20hall%20for%20my%20ride%20with%20caffeine%20in%20hand%2C%20feeling%20proud%20of%20myself%20for%20being%20ready%20with%2025%20minutes%20to%20spare.%20Soon%2C%20though%2C%20I%20realized%20my%20track%20wasn't%20even%20listed%20yet.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20idled%20in%20the%20waiting%20area%2C%20the%20minutes%20ticking%20by%20without%20any%20news%20on%20my%20train.%20It%20ended%20up%20getting%20delayed%20over%20an%20hour%20for%20maintenance%2C%20and%20the%20track%20listing%20didn't%20become%20available%20until%20about%2010%20minutes%20before%20it%20left.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20my%20return%20trip%20rolled%20around%2C%20I%20realized%20the%2040%20minutes%20I%20had%20given%20myself%20would%20have%20felt%20too%20long%20whether%20the%20train%20was%20delayed%20or%20not.%20My%20train%20from%20Rochester%20to%20Manhattan%20was%20supposed%20to%20depart%20at%201%3A27%2C%20and%20I%20made%20it%20to%20the%20station%20by%201%20p.m.%20My%20fellow%20passengers%20and%20I%20weren't%20even%20allowed%20to%20move%20toward%20the%20train%20until%201%3A20%2C%20which%20left%20me%20feeling%20antsy%20while%20I%20waited.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'd%20rather%20be%20early%20than%20late%20when%20it%20comes%20to%20travel%2C%20but%20next%20time%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-train-ride-what-to-pack-frequent-traveler-2025-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EI%20take%20Amtrak%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20I'll%20probably%20arrive%2020%20minutes%20before%20my%20train%20is%20scheduled%20instead%20of%2030.%20Lollygag%20at%20your%20own%20risk.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI%20sat%20on%20the%20wrong%20side%20of%20the%20train.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20photo%20of%20two%20seats%20on%20an%20Amtrak%20train.%20A%20pink%20backpack%20and%20water%20bottle%20sit%20on%20one%20seat.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F683dfe786ffb6822ec61e957%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3ESamantha%20Pettyjohn%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20train%20bound%20for%20Rochester%20didn't%20have%20assigned%20seating%2C%20which%20made%20me%20a%20little%20nervous.%20I%20was%20among%20the%20final%20people%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fthings-you-should-never-do-on-train-etiquette-tips%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eboard%20the%20train%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20so%20I%20grabbed%20the%20first%20open%20seat%20I%20saw.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20was%20relieved%20I%20snagged%20a%20row%20to%20myself%20for%20the%20whole%20seven-hour%20journey%2C%20but%20as%20we%20rolled%20through%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fregion-new-york-resembles-french-countryside-hudson-valley-2025-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eupstate%20New%20York%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20I%20noticed%20the%20side%20I%20was%20sitting%20on%20didn't%20have%20as%20nice%20a%20view%20as%20the%20one%20opposite%20me.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20mostly%20saw%20other%20trains%20from%20my%20window%2C%20while%20sweeping%20landscapes%20and%20the%20Hudson%20River%20were%20visible%20from%20the%20windows%20on%20the%20other%20side%20of%20the%20train.%20Because%20the%20train%20was%20pretty%20packed%2C%20I%20couldn't%20move%20to%20the%20other%20side%20while%20still%20having%20a%20row%20to%20myself%2C%20either.%20I%20craned%20my%20neck%20to%20take%20a%20peek%20at%20the%20other%20side%20often%2C%20trying%20to%20get%20glimpses%20of%20the%20landscape.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20ended%20up%20sitting%20in%20a%20seat%20that%20gave%20me%20gorgeous%20views%20of%20New%20York%20for%20the%20return%20trip%2C%20but%20I%20wished%20I%20could%20have%20seen%20the%20area%20well%20on%20both%20routes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ELooking%20back%2C%20I%20should%20have%20anticipated%20that%20WiFi%20would%20be%20spotty%20on%20board.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20selfie%20of%20a%20woman%20sitting%20on%20an%20Amtrak%20car.%20A%20backpack%20sits%20in%20the%20seat%20next%20to%20her.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6862c8cef748d8c055f4a718%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3ESamantha%20Pettyjohn%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBefore%20my%20Rochester%20trip%2C%20I%20remembered%20easily%20scrolling%20on%20my%20phone%20to%20pass%20the%20time%20on%20my%20other%20Amtrak%20journeys.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20hadn't%20ever%20worked%20or%20used%20my%20laptop%20to%20stream%20on%20Amtrak%2C%20though%2C%20so%20I%20didn't%20give%20much%20thought%20to%20the%20WiFi%20situation%20on%20board%2C%20which%20was%20included%20with%20my%20ticket.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETo%20my%20surprise%2C%20WiFi%20was%20unavailable%20for%20the%20first%20bit%20of%20the%20journey%20from%20New%20York%20City%20to%20Rochester%20because%20you%20exit%20Penn%20Station%20through%20a%20fairly%20long%20tunnel.%20WiFi%20became%20available%20once%20we%20cleared%20it%2C%20but%20the%20internet%20was%20still%20spotty%2C%20cutting%20out%20sporadically.%20I%20found%20it%20hard%20to%20get%20work%20done%20on%20my%20laptop%20or%20my%20phone%2C%20and%20when%20I%20tried%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fstreaming%2Fwhere-to-watch-ted-lasso%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Estream%20a%20show%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20my%20laptop%2C%20it%20buffered%20pretty%20frequently.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELuckily%2C%20I%20had%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhy-i-like-my-kindle-for-reading-and-travel-2023-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Emy%20Kindle%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20backup%20entertainment%2C%20but%20having%20more%20options%20would%20have%20been%20nice.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENext%20time%2C%20I'll%20download%20a%20few%20shows%20or%20movies%20ahead%20of%20the%20ride%2C%20just%20in%20case%20the%20internet%20cuts%20out.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI%20wish%20I%20hadn't%20sat%20at%20the%20very%20back%20of%20the%20train%20for%20my%20return%20journey.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20photo%20of%20a%20business%20class%20car%20on%20an%20Amtrak%20train.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6862d7e885e81483682d0fd5%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3ESamantha%20Pettyjohn%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20my%20return%20trip%20to%20New%20York%2C%20I%20was%20excited%20to%20ride%20in%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-cabin-differences-coach-business-first-class-roomette-bedroom%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebusiness-class%3C%2Fa%3E%20car%20at%20the%20back%20of%20the%20train.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EUnfortunately%2C%20the%20car%20was%20fairly%20small%20and%20had%20limited%20seating%2C%20so%20I%20sat%20in%20a%20chair%20in%20the%20last%20row%20for%20most%20of%20the%20journey.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBecause%20it%20was%20at%20the%20back%2C%20the%20entire%20business-class%20car%20was%20bumpier%20than%20the%C2%A0%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcoach-amtrak-ride-vancouver-to-seattle-surprising-things-2025-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ecoach%20car%3C%2Fa%3E%C2%A0I%20sat%20in%20on%20my%20ride%20to%20Rochester%2C%20and%20it%20only%20got%20worse%20in%20the%20last%20row.%20It%20was%20like%20I%20could%20feel%20nearly%20every%20groove%20and%20jolt%20in%20the%20track%2C%20so%20it%20was%20hard%20to%20relax.%20I%20couldn't%20sleep%20for%20any%20part%20of%20the%20ride%2C%20and%20I%20ended%20up%20regretting%20splurging%20on%20the%20fancier%20ticket.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'd%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-business-class-vs-coach-maple-leaf-train-new-york-2025-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eskip%20business%20class%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20a%20ride%20upstate%20for%20a%20few%20reasons%2C%20but%20the%20bumpy%20feel%20was%20one%20of%20the%20biggest.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EPacking%20snacks%20would%20have%20been%20wise.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20bag%20of%20chips%2C%20a%20pre-packaged%20caeser%20salad%2C%20plastic%20silverware%2C%20and%20an%20Amtrak%20napkin%20on%20a%20tray%20table%20on%20a%20train.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F68a49e75194a2d49b8aec96b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3ESamantha%20Pettyjohn%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBecause%20my%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-coach-business-class-compared-not-worth-upgrade-2025-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etrain%20rides%3C%2Fa%3E%20were%20over%20seven%20hours%2C%20I%20knew%20I'd%20be%20eating%20a%20meal%20on%20both%20journeys.%20For%20my%20trip%20from%20New%20York%20City%20to%20Rochester%2C%20I%20had%20lunch%20and%20got%20a%20surprisingly%20good%20salad%20and%20a%20bag%20of%20chips%20from%20the%20caf%C3%A9%20car.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHowever%2C%20the%20caf%C3%A9%20car%20closed%20for%20an%20hour%20of%20the%20journey%2C%20which%20would%20have%20been%20a%20problem%20if%20I%20had%20timed%20my%20lunch%20incorrectly%20or%20wanted%20a%20snack.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20aware%20I%20can%20get%20hangry%2C%20so%20for%20my%20return%20trip%2C%20I%20packed%20some%20Cheez-Its%20as%20a%20backup%20snack%20in%20case%20the%20caf%C3%A9%20closure%20coincided%20with%20my%20hunger.%20The%20caf%C3%A9%20car%20is%20definitely%20a%20perk%20of%20Amtrak%2C%20but%20I'd%20recommend%20bringing%20extra%20snacks%20in%20case%20it's%20unavailable.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EMy%20biggest%20mistake%20was%20booking%20a%20train%20with%20a%20long%20stop.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20seflie%20of%20a%20woman%20in%20front%20of%20an%20Amtrak%20sign%20that%20says%20%26quot%3BAlbany-Rensselaer%2C%20NY.%26quot%3B%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F683e01adca50259add4d7807%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3ESamantha%20Pettyjohn%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20left%20New%20York%20City%20early%20on%20a%20Thursday%20and%20planned%20to%20return%20on%20Friday%20afternoon.%20Since%20it%20was%20such%20a%20short%20trip%2C%20I%20wanted%20to%20give%20myself%20time%20to%20do%20some%20sightseeing%20in%20the%20morning%20before%20heading%20back%20to%20the%20city.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20was%20focused%20on%20departure%20time%20instead%20of%20arrival%20time%20for%20my%20return%2C%20not%20noticing%20until%20after%20I%20booked%20my%20ticket%20that%20the%20trip%20back%20would%20take%20nine%20hours%20instead%20of%20the%20seven%20it%20took%20to%20get%20to%20Rochester.%20I%20thought%20maybe%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fways-to-improve-long-train-rides-tips-frequent-amtrak-traveler%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ethe%20train%3C%2Fa%3E%20would%20be%20making%20more%20stops%2C%20but%20it%20actually%20made%20an%20extended%20stop%20in%20Albany%20for%20over%20an%20hour%20and%20a%20half%20to%20connect%20with%20another%20train.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20long%20stop%20turned%20out%20to%20be%20much%20more%20annoying%20than%20more%20frequent%20stops.%20During%20the%20pause%2C%20the%20lights%20were%20off%2C%20the%20AC%20only%20came%20on%20sporadically%2C%20and%20the%20caf%C3%A9%20car%20was%20closed.%20I%20was%20frustrated%20when%20I%20realized%20what%20was%20happening%2C%20but%20I%20had%20no%20one%20to%20blame%20but%20myself.%20Amtrak%20had%20clearly%20listed%20the%20estimated%20arrival%20time%20on%20my%20ticket%20when%20I%20purchased%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20made%20the%20most%20of%20the%20time%20we%20were%20stopped%2C%20grabbing%20a%20lackluster%20dinner%20from%20a%20small%20caf%C3%A9%20at%20the%20Albany%20station%20and%20walking%20around%20to%20stretch%20my%20legs.%20It%20wasn't%20a%20huge%20problem%20in%20the%20grand%20scheme%20of%20things%2C%20but%20next%20time%2C%20I'll%20pay%20closer%20attention%20to%20journey%20length%20when%20booking%20an%20Amtrak%20ticket.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EIt%20sounds%20silly%2C%20but%20I%20should%20have%20been%20more%20careful%20with%20my%20body%20as%20I%20got%20used%20to%20riding%20the%20train.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20selfie%20of%20a%20woman%20sitting%20on%20a%20train.%20It's%20dark%20outside%20in%20the%20nearby%20window.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F68a486d2cfc04e97619ba006%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3ESamantha%20Pettyjohn%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20a%20pretty%20clumsy%20person%20by%20nature.%20I%20trip%20often%2C%20and%20anyone%20who%20has%20thrown%20a%20ball%20my%20way%20knows%20I%20lack%20basic%20hand-eye%20coordination.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20didn't%20think%20that%20would%20matter%20on%20a%20train%2C%20but%20when%20I%20repeatedly%20bonked%20my%20head%20on%20the%20luggage%20shelving%20above%20my%20seats%2C%20I%20realized%20my%20miscalculation.%20It%20was%20easy%20to%20lose%20my%20balance%20as%20I%20maneuvered%20around%20the%20moving%20train%2C%20leading%20me%20to%20knock%20my%20head%20more%20than%20once%20on%20the%20shelves%20above%20my%20seat%20when%20I%20got%20in%20and%20out%20of%20my%20chair.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20might%20not%20be%20a%20problem%20for%20every%20train%20rider%2C%20but%20I%20hope%20other%20clumsy%20people%20heed%20my%20warning.%20I%20wish%20I%20had%20moved%20a%20little%20more%20slowly%20and%20with%20more%20care%20on%20the%20train%2C%20as%20I%20likely%20could%20have%20avoided%20some%20bumps%20and%20bruises.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-travel-mistakes-new-york-train-trip-2026-8%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785949551000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F68a48adca17a8c5b4053155e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Famtrak-travel-mistakes-new-york-train-trip-2026-8%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22On%20a%20round-trip%20Amtrak%20ride%20from%20New%20York%20City%20to%20Rochester%2C%20I%20regretted%20sitting%20in%20business%20class%20and%20arriving%20too%20early.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22sgrindell%40businessinsider.com%20(Samantha%20Grindell%20Pettyjohn)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A0%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Indian-origin%20man%20among%205%20convicted%20in%20UK%20child%20sexual%20exploitation%2C%20human%20trafficking%20case%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785949486000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-132953288%2Cimgsize-735355.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Fuk%2Findian-origin-man-among-5-convicted-in-uk-child-sexual-exploitation-human-trafficking-case%2Farticleshow%2F132953288.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22%3Cimg%20border%3D%5C%220%5C%22%20align%3D%5C%22left%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fphoto%2F132953288.cms%5C%22%20hspace%3D